{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05405","headline":"享太庙乐章 保大舞 · 郭子仪","name":"享太庙乐章 保大舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆文考，圣神昭彰。\n箫勺羣慝，含光远方。\n万物茂遂，九夷宾王。\n愔愔云韶，德音不忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭子仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}